    "category": "game-console",
    "description": "1989 年任天堂推出的 8 位掌上游戏机，以 160×144 点阵 4 级灰度屏与俄罗斯方块捆绑开创手提机品类，是最畅销掌机之一。",
    "authors": [
      {
        "name": "箱庭电子博物馆项目组",
        "role": "author"
      }
    ],
    "intro": {
      "zh": "Game Boy 是任天堂于 1989 年推出的 8 位掌上游戏机，是横井军平枯萎技术的水平思考的集大成之作。它以 160×144 点阵 4 级灰度的无背光屏、Sharp LR35902 处理器与 4 节 AA 电池供电，用够用的硬件与俄罗斯方块捆绑，开辟了手提机这一全新品类，累计销量约 1.18 亿台（含 Game Boy Color）。",
      "en": "The Game Boy is an 8-bit handheld console released by Nintendo in 1989, the culmination of Gunpei Yokoi's lateral thinking of withered technology. With a 160x144 4-shade reflective LCD, the Sharp LR35902 CPU and four AA batteries, it created the handheld category through the Tetris bundle, selling about 118 million units including the Game Boy Color."
    },
